  "limits": [
    "The game trial only issues and retires GPU-image leases; it does not read their pixels in a consumer or submit them to XR. Exact GPU pixels are verified in owned synthetic controls.",
    "The trial has no vkDestroyDevice trace and does not directly measure final game pool counters or completion of each final retirement fence. All owned processes exited and game/vendor files were audited.",
    "Four slots and 256 MiB are enforced by the component and tested in the portable/GPU controls. These are not measured whole-game GPU memory costs.",
    "Ready leases are not guaranteed to be delivered in presentation order; 3 adjacent inversions were observed. A consumer must order/select by origin and retire/drop late frames rather than relabel them.",
    "No requested XR pose/time is known for these immutable game eye packets; the left and right images are sequential, not a coherent same-instant pair.",
    "Connecting to the projection session still requires safe XR pacing, resource ownership and either real requested-pose rendering or an explicit approximate temporal mode.",
    "Prior real SteamVR internal validation errors remain unresolved. No new headset test, complete-world coverage or Windows D3D12 backend is claimed."
  ],
